 "description": "This guide provides step-by-step instructions on how to add or terminate an employee/manager in the RTI/XBO system. It covers both the process of adding an employee, including retrieving their Employee ID and filling out necessary information, as well as the process of terminating an employee, including selecting the reason and providing additional information. Whether you are using RTI or XBO, this guide will help you navigate the system and complete these tasks effectively.",
 "section": "Office ScribeHows",
